01:37:00.750 --> 01:37:13.179
Ansgar Dietrichs: try our hardest here to see, is there something that we can do that actually satisfies all the needs from all sides? Ultimately, the L1 will go ahead with whatever is best for the L1. That has always been the case, that will be the case, but I do think

