01:41:07.620 --> 01:41:26.120
Felix: So I think that's… that would be the way forward. And, to Chris's point there in the chat, so, the way it works with 8141 and the mempool is just that we just need the guarantee that a single action on the contract cannot invalidate many

658
01:41:27.190 --> 01:41:36.420
