661
01:42:01.660 --> 01:42:18.560
Felix: But I think with the key store, that doesn't really exist, because you need to send a specific transaction or a specific account to remove or add one key, in which case only one transaction can be invalidated. It does, however, mean that in the long run, we have to make sure the

662
01:42:19.250 --> 01:42:29.740
